    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stick the same mushrooms together to evolve! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for a high score by changing mushrooms to prevent them from overflowing the basket!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the basket overflows, the game is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for a high score by creating large matsutake mushrooms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three modes: &quot;Normal Mode,&quot; &quot;Shiitake Mode&quot; with only &quot;Shiitake Mushrooms,&quot; and &quot;Tango Mode&quot; featuring mushrooms selected by special mushroom master Virtual Streamer Kinokoma Tango! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ranking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for the top ranking and make matsutake mushrooms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is the function for streamers? </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A function to play in portrait mode for streamers is included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streamer Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbIt can be distributed without permission, regardless of whether it is an individual or a corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbWe are not responsible for any damage caused by distributing videos of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The contents of these guidelines may change without notice.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stick the same mushrooms together to evolve! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for a high score by changing mushrooms to prevent them from overflowing the basket!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the basket overflows, the game is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for a high score by creating large matsutake mushrooms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three modes: &quot;Normal Mode,&quot; &quot;Shiitake Mode&quot; with only &quot;Shiitake Mushrooms,&quot; and &quot;Tango Mode&quot; featuring mushrooms selected by special mushroom master Virtual Streamer Kinokoma Tango! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ranking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for the top ranking and make matsutake mushrooms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is the function for streamers? </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A function to play in portrait mode for streamers is included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streamer Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbIt can be distributed without permission, regardless of whether it is an individual or a corporation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbWe are not responsible for any damage caused by distributing videos of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The contents of these guidelines may change without notice.</p>",
